{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"carcass_bones","model_identifier":"carcass_bones","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# carcass_bones\n\nPicked-clean carcass: a spine, rib cage, skull and scattered leg bones on a dark stain, about 1.2 m long (deer-sized; scale 0.5 for a hare, 1.4 for a bear).\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -17..20, y 0..9, z -32..26 units (1.07 x 0.24 x 1.63 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 64 x 128, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 33.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 38 x 9 x 58 (w x h x d), centred at x 1, z -3\n\n## Notes\n\n- Shown once a `carcass_<animal>` has been butchered; fades away after a while.\n"},"resolution":{"width":64,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"stain","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-9.0,0.0,-20.0],"to":[9.0,0.3,22.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[42.0,61.7,60.0,62.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,61.7,42.0,62.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[42.0,61.7,60.0,62.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.0,61.7,42.0,62.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,0.0,18.0,42.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,0.0,18.0,42.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"66643eeb-414a-521a-a7d4-236ab7052edb"},{"name":"stain_b","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[9.0,0.0,-4.0],"to":[15.0,0.3,8.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[46.0,63.7,52.0,64.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,62.7,12.0,63.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[46.0,63.7,52.0,64.0],"texture":